;**************************************************************
; GSD-File for Phoenix Contact IL PB BK DP/V1
; Article-No.      : 2718688 (usage with DIP8 = ON)
; Hardware-Release : 02
; Firmware-Release : B (42 hex)
; GSD-Revision     : 1.44
; Date             : 30.03.2017
;**************************************************************
;****************** Changes ***********************************
;  Date        Change
;  11.07.2002  First Release
;  14.10.2002  New modules added
;  23.01.2003  New modules added
;  30.01.2003  ID-Code fixed
;  18.07.2003  New modules & options
;  22.10.2003  New parameters for INC/SSI
;  10.05.2004  New modules & parameters
;  03.05.2005  New modules & parameters
;              New Parameters for SSI-IN, IMPULSE-IN, EC AR
;              New Modules: TEMP 4/8 RTD, AO 4/8/U/BP, RS232-PRO
;              packed 120 DI 1, packed DI 2-NPN, IL 332
;              Parameters: Baudrate 45.45, MaxTsdr, Fail_Safe,
;              DPV1_Data_Types, Ext_User_Prm_Data_Const for BK
;  25.05.2005  changed desription for RS...-PRO
;              module consistency for AO 4/8, TEMP 4/8
;  02.06.2005  separate entries for TEMPCON 300 models
;  30.09.2005  SGI module added
;  04.11.2005  AI4 module added
;  05.01.2006  FLM modules added
;  25.01.2006  Review & Release
;  04.04.2006  AI4 module parameters revised
;  12.04.2006  FLM BT BS 3 added
;  23.05.2006  IB IL AO2/I/S7 added
;              Modbus RTU/ASCII added to IB IL RS485
;  12.06.2006  Pre-Settings for DP/V1 Status 2
;  25.07.2006  Changed AI2/SF-ME parameters
;              Added ILC 200 UNI with ID 0xBF, Length 0x08
;              Added FLM DI16, FLM DIO8/8
;              New Parameters for ELR and MLR
;  25.06.2007  FLM TEMP 4 RTD M12 added
;			   Add failsafe to FLM BT BS 3 modules and expand it
;			   FLM TEMP 4 RTD M12 and FLM AI 4 M12 modules parameters revised
;  09.07.2007  FLM BT BS 3 modules parameters revised
;  14.08.2007  IL SGI 2/F modules parameters revised
;  15.01.2008  IL SGI 2/P , IL TEMP 4/8 RTD/EF and FLM DO8 M8 modules added
;  03.07.2008  Fail_Safe set to 0.
;              IB IL AI/TEMP 4 RTD-PAC added.
;  17.12.2008  IB IL 24/230 DOR 4/HC-PC, IB IL IOL 4 DI 12, FLM IOL 4 DI 4 M12 added.
;  18.02.2009  Changed IB IL 24/230 DOR 4/HC-PC to IB IL 24/230 DOR 4/HC-PAC and revised parameters
;  07.07.2009  IL SGI 2/F modules parameters revised
;  26.01.2010  IB IL DO 4 AC-1A modules parameters revised
;              IB IL 24 DO 16-ME and IB IL 24 DI 16-ME added
;              IB IL 24 DO 8/HD-PAC and IB IL 24 DO 8/HD-PAC added.
;              PCP-Paramter revised
;  29.01.2010  SafetyBridge modules added.
;  30.03.2010  Added IB IL SGI 1/CAL, IB IL TEMP 4 UTH HEI 1 DO4, IB IL TEMP 6 UTH HEI 1 DO6, IB IL TEMP 8 UTH HEI 1 DO8
;              IB IL DALI-PAC, IB IL DALI/PWR-PAC module . IOL-Modules revised.
;  04.05.2010  Max_User_Prm_Data_Len changed
;  08.10.2010  Added Module "IB IL SGI 1/CAL noPrm" without konfig-parameter, 
;              changed parameter "Nominal load (MAX)" default value 1, "Adjustment value" default value 1 from "IB IL SGI 1/CAL".
;  22.10.2010  SGI 1/CAL default settings changed
;  06.04.2011  Add "IB IL AI 4/U" , "IB IL AI 4/I" and "IB IL EX-IS DIO4" modules.
;              Add "IB IL IFS-MA ID ... PD ...", "IB IL CAN-MA 1.SuPI ...Byte" modules.
;  17.05.2011  Changed parameter "IB IL AI 4/U" , "IB IL AI 4/I.
;  09.08.2011  Add "IB IL 24 LPSDO 24W", "IB IL 24 PSDO 8 SBT", "IB IL 24 PSDOR 4 SBT", "IB IL 24 PSDO 4/4 SBT",
;               "IB IL 24 LPSDO MUX SBT V2", "IB IL 24 LPSDO 16W SBT V2", "IB IL 24 LPSDO 24W SBT V2"
;  02.09.2011  "IB IL AI 4/U" and "IB IL AI 4/I" data consistency changed (unit)
;  15.09.2011  Add "IB IL AO 2/UI"
;  16.07.2012  Changed config table parameter for "IB IL TEMP 4/8 RTD/EF".
;  14.08.2012  Changed lengthcode for "IB IL DOR 2/W".
;  22.08.2012  Add info text.
;  09.11.2012  Add "IB IL RS UNI 7W", "IB IL RS UNI 15W", "IB IL RS UNI 31W" module.
;  13.02.2013  Support new "IB IL PM 3P/N/EF" FW V1.9 with new parameter.
;  26.09.2013  Support "IB IL TEMP 8 RTD/UTH" module.
;  30.06.2014  Changed parametrization mode from "IB IL AI 2/SF" and "IB IL AI 4/EF" to quick config.
;  24.11.2014  Add "IB IL 24 LPSDO SBT V3" module.
;  26.02.2015  Add "IB IL MBUS" module.
;  21.01.2016  Delete "IB IL EX-IS DIO4", changed settings "IB IL PM 3P/N/EF"
;  28.03.2017  Added "IB IL AI 4/I/4-20-ECO", "IB IL AI 4/U/0-10-ECO", IB IL RTD 4/PT100-ECO, IB IL RTD 4/PT1000-ECO,
;                      IB IL UTH 4/J-ECO, IB IL UTH 4/K-ECO, IB IL UTH 4/L-ECO, IB IL AO 4/I/4-20-ECO, IB IL AO 4/U/0-10-ECO.
;                      IB IL 24/230 DOR 1/W-PC-XC, IB IL 24 DI8/HD-ECO, IB IL 24 DO8/HD-ECO, "IB IL RS 232-ECO", "IB IL RS 485-ECO",
;					   			"IB IL DO 4/EF-ECO", "IB IL SAFE 2-ECO".
; 30.03.2017	Remove "IB IL RS 485-ECO"
;**************************************************************

